    "title": "Idaho nuclear power plant proposed to be built in Jerome County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Jerome County, Idaho\nIdaho nuclear power plant proposed to be built in Jerome County\n3 hours ago\nBOISE, Idaho — Jerome County may be home to Idaho's only commercial nuclear power plant, which is being proposed to be built on federal land. Sawtooth Energy & Development Corporation issued a draft environmental impact statement of the \"Midpoint Small Modular Reactor Project #1,\" a project aiming to build three to six power modules on 320 acres of Bureau of Land Management land.",
